cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use PsychMetal in work you publish, please cite it. It is
  experimental research software and has not been validated against a
  photodiode; say so if your timing claims depend on it.
title: "PsychMetal: direct Metal stimulus presentation on Apple silicon"
abstract: >-
  A native Metal presentation library with supported Screen-style commands
  that presents through CAMetalLayer and reports MTLDrawable.presentedTime,
  with native Metal drawing primitives and no OpenGL. One engine serves
  MATLAB, Octave and Python (the psychmetal package on PyPI). Keeps Screen's
  argument formats so that existing code ports, and copies none of its
  implementation.
type: software
authors:
